~ melodic_intro_start
do MelodicGameManager.metronome.mute_metronome(true)
Gee: Woah! It’s completely dark here!
Dakki: Where are we?
Gee: That’s a good question, I’m not sure…
Dakki: Let’s try looking around.
do wait(3.0)
Dakki: It’s really hard to navigate in the dark…
Gee: And it’s really lonely actually… I can’t even remember making this game in the first place.
Dakki: Well we have to keep going, but there must be some way we can navigate the dark.
Gee: Okay this may sound crazy, but what if we use echolocation?
Dakki: Echolocation? You mean the thing bats use to navigate the dark?
Gee: Yeah, I’ll make a sound and based on how much it echoes, we can know if there are walls!
Dakki: I mean, it’s better than nothing…
Gee: *Starts humming a song*
Dakki: I don’t think a song is going to he-
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.set_can_fade_out(true)
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.fade_out()
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.set_can_fade_out(false)
Dakki: Woah!
Gee: No way! The song is illuminating everything just enough to see!
Dakki: Hey wait, keep singing! Everything is going back to darkness when you’re not!
Gee: Gee, I thought you didn’t believe in my singing!
: Press 'E' to sing
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.set_can_fade_out(true)
=> END

~ melodic_intro_part2
Dakki: So what’s up with these outfits anyways?
Gee: I’m not sure, but I do look pretty in mine!
Dakki: Okay, no time for idle chatter, keep singing!
Gee: I’m starting to get tired singing every second, it’s your turn now!
Dakki: Well… What if I don’t want to? It’s more your thing anyways.
Gee: Come on! Let me have a break!
Dakki: I’m just assuming you’re the one who got us in this mess, so you have to resolve it.
Gee: There must be an easier way than constantly singing to illuminate everything…
???: Oh no what am I to do?
Gee: Was that another person’s voice?
Dakki: Yeah, come on, let’s hurry!
=> END

~ melodic_intro_meet_guy
???: What will I do? I can’t see anything, I lost all my bandmates, and I’m just lost…
Dakki: Looks like there’s our voice.
Gee: Do you need any help mister?
???: OMG, can you help me???
Dakki: This guy is intense…
???: Oh you can sing! That would help a lot!
Dakki: That’s besides the point, please continue.
???: Ahem… sorry. Anyways these darkness monsters started accumulating into the world and it scared off all my bandmates.
Gee: Ooh! A band sounds like fun!
???: And ever since they left, the world has gone full dark.
Gee: Of course!
???: Thank you!
Dakki: What do you need help with anyways?
???: Well this world, if you haven’t noticed, is filled with darkness.
Dakki: Yeah we learned that the hard way…
Gee: But my singing has helped us see!
Dakki: It seems, however, based on our little experimenting that these monsters…
Gee: Are weak to music!
???: Ah. . . It’s Hopeless!
Gee: Woah!
Dakki: Calm down sir, what do you mean?
???: All the instruments in the world are with those musicians and they are all gone! All gone!
Gee: Well we just need to find them then!
Dakki: Gee, you think eventually if we full illuminate the world, we can go to the next one?
Gee: It seems like it! Mister let us help!
???: Oh thank you! Thank you! You said you can sing right? Can you both sing and maybe it will have twice the effect?
Dakki: Ain’t no way I’m singing!
Gee: Come on Dakki!
???: Well I do have this drum kit that I used when we were all together!
Dakki: I’ll play! Please don’t make me sing.
???: Let me show you how to play!
Dakki: Actually I used to play before so there’s no need. Although I’m a little rusty so it’ll take a bit before I can fully get back to playing.
Gee: But that means I don’t have to sing every second now!
Dakki: I don’t think the drums will be strong enough to take out these so called darkness monsters though, so you will need to sing to take them out!
???: I’ll drive the drums around, so don’t worry about us idol girl.
Gee: Idol girl, I kinda like that.
Dakki: Okay let me get setup.
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.fade_out_continuously(true)
do MelodicGameManager.metronome.mute_metronome(false)
do MelodicGameManager.darkness.set_can_fade_out(false)
Gee: Woah! Alright let’s find the music!
=> END